.TH HOMELAB-BACKUP-SERVER 8 "August 2026" "homelab-backup-server" "Homelab Administration"
.SH NAME
homelab-backup-server \- centralized borg backup server, control-plane enrollment reconciler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B homelab-backup-server
.I command
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B homelab-backup-server
manages client enrollment on the centralized borg backup server: it creates
each client's restricted repo directory and appends a forced-command SSH key
entry to the borgbackup service account's authorized_keys, so client hosts
never need SSH or sudo access to this machine to onboard.

Client hosts normally enroll themselves through the homelab-api control plane
(\fBhomelab-cli backup enroll\fR); this server's \fBreconcile\fR subcommand,
run automatically on a timer by
.BR homelab-backup-server-reconcile.timer ,
polls for pending enroll/revoke requests and applies them here.
\fBenroll\fR/\fBlist\fR/\fBrevoke\fR/\fBadmin-recovery-key\fR remain available
for manual or emergency use at any time.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI "enroll " identifier " " pubkey
Enroll a new client host: creates its restricted repo directory and grants it
SSH access. \fIpubkey\fR may be the key contents or a path to a \fB.pub\fR
file.
.TP
.B list
List enrolled client identifiers.
.TP
.BI "revoke " identifier
Revoke a client's enrollment (removes its authorized_keys entry).
.TP
.B admin-recovery-key
Generate/install a broader admin recovery SSH key that can restore any host's
repo on this server.
.TP
.B setup
Interactively connect this server to the homelab-api control plane
(bootstrapping its own service account if needed), register this host as the
backup server, and install/enable the reconciliation timer. Safe to re-run
any time to change settings.
.TP
.B reconcile
Poll homelab-api for pending enroll/revoke requests and apply them. Normally
invoked only by
.BR homelab-backup-server-reconcile.timer ,
never directly. Fails soft (a warning, exit 0) on any control-plane error,
without touching authorized_keys, so an API outage can never disable the
timer.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/homelab/backup/server/config.yml
Server configuration: backup_user, backup_location, homelab_api_url,
homelab_cli.*, reconcile.interval_seconds.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR homelab-backup-client (8),
.BR homelab-cli (1)
